--- A list of a kind no row of the builtin takes is refused naming its
--- items' kind: `sort` of fractions had been refused as `got a list`,
--- naming no kind at all (Rosetta Code, Rational calculator) — fractions
--- sort now (Vijay, 2026-10-29), and records, which have no order, are
--- refused so

struct P [x]

xs = push[push[[], P[2]], P[1]]
log[sort[xs]]
